{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107858","id":2609814320,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bjpsw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107858","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107858.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107858.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107858","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107858/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107858/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107858/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/de2aa1bc4dcc632210e1b09acb1033bc7cae8ed9","number":107858,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Ensure sky orientation is set when reflection uses sky","user":{"login":"Mingxi-Z","id":100094557,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfdSXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100094557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Mingxi-Z","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In the Forward+ and Mobile rendering backends, sky reflections were missing when the environment was configured with:\r\n- Background mode set to `Clear Color` or `Color`.\r\n- Ambient Light source set to `Background`.\r\n\r\nThis was caused by the sky orientation transform (`radiance_inverse_xform`) not being set in this specific configuration, even though the `USE_REFLECTION_CUBEMAP` flag was correctly enabled. \r\n\r\nThis change decouples the sky orientation logic from the ambient light setup. The `radiance_inverse_xform` is now updated whenever either the ambient or reflection cubemap is in use.\r\n\r\nFixes: #98487\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":